@using Yello.Client.Spaces

@inject IStringLocalizer<ClientCopy> Localizer
@inject SpaceWrites Writes
@inject ActiveSpaceState ActiveSpace
@implements IDisposable

@*
    THE BULK MOVE BAR: every Task of one Status moved into another Project, in one request.

    DRAWN BY ITS HOST ABOVE THE COLUMNS OR THE ROWS, never inside a column, so blocking a column can never take it away. It
    is the one component bordered in the accent: the only transient operation that runs over many Tasks at once, and it must
    be unmistakable while it runs. The accent says nothing about danger.

    BEFORE THE COMMIT it names its scope in a status line, holds the single move's Project picker (nothing selected, one tab
    stop per step, Esc steps back), and holds the only Cancel. Focus is in it from the moment it appears.

    THE COMMIT is one transaction already sent, so it cannot be cancelled: Cancel goes, Esc is ignored, and the picker's
    status line says "Moving {n} Tasks." and holds focus. No percentage, no progress bar. A second press sends nothing.

    A REFUSAL keeps the bar and says why, and that nothing moved; a move that got no answer says only that it was not sent,
    and sending the same choice again reuses its Idempotency-Key.
*@

<section class="bulk-move-bar" aria-label="@Localizer["BulkMoveBarName"]" @onkeydown="KeyDownAsync">
    @if (!_inFlight)
    {
        <p class="bulk-move-bar__scope" role="status" tabindex="-1" @ref="_scope">@ScopeText</p>
    }

    @if (_refusal is { } refusal)
    {
        <p class="bulk-move-bar__refusal">@refusal</p>
    }

    <ProjectMovePicker SpaceId="@SpaceId"
                       ProjectId="@ProjectId"
                       StatusId="@StatusId"
                       StatusName="@StatusName"
                       InFlightText="@InFlightText"
                       OnCommit="CommitAsync"
                       OnDismiss="CancelAsync" />

    @if (!_inFlight)
    {
        <div class="bulk-move-bar__actions">
            <button type="button" class="button-secondary" @onclick="CancelAsync">@Localizer["BulkMoveCancel"]</button>
        </div>
    }
</section>
